Subject: [PATCH 2/6] ASoC: rsrc-card: add convert channels support
In-Reply-To: <877fht7376.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
References: <877fht7376.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
